{
  "title": "Placement Group · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "EC2의 배치 관계를 조절해 통신 성능이나 장애 분리에 맞춥니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Placement Group</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/#guide-1\">세 가지 배치 전략</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/#guide-2\">애플리케이션 요구와 연결하기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>컴퓨팅</span><span>36 / 62</span></div><h1>Placement Group</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>배치 그룹은 <strong>EC2 인스턴스가 물리적으로 배치되는 관계를 조절하는 기능</strong>입니다. 서로 가까이 배치해 통신 성능을 높이거나, 하드웨어 장애 영향을 나누는 데 사용합니다.</p><p>일반적인 여러 AZ 배치와 함께, 애플리케이션이 어떤 통신 패턴과 장애 특성을 갖는지 보고 배치 전략을 선택합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"comparison\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"cluster-placement-group\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"partition-placement-group\"></span><h2>세 가지 배치 전략</h2><p><strong>클러스터:</strong> 한 AZ 안에 인스턴스를 가깝게 배치합니다. 인스턴스 간 낮은 지연과 높은 처리량이 중요한 병렬 계산에 적합합니다.</p><p><strong>스프레드:</strong> 소수의 중요한 인스턴스를 서로 다른 하드웨어에 분산합니다. 같은 하드웨어 장애가 여러 인스턴스에 동시에 영향을 주는 것을 줄입니다.</p><p><strong>파티션:</strong> 인스턴스를 여러 파티션<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup>으로 나눠 하드웨어 장애 영역을 분리합니다. 분산 데이터 처리 시스템이 복제본을 나눠 배치하는 데 사용할 수 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"spread-placement-group\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"availability-zone-and-capacity\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"placement-group-selection\"></span><h2>애플리케이션 요구와 연결하기</h2><p>성능을 위해 가까이 둘지, 장애를 줄이기 위해 떨어뜨릴지를 먼저 판단합니다. 배치 그룹만으로 데이터 복제나 자동 장애 전환이 구현되지는 않습니다.</p><p>지원되는 인스턴스 유형과 그룹별 용량 제약을 확인합니다. 동일한 유형을 함께 시작하는 등 필요한 용량을 확보할 실행 계획도 마련합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>배치 전략 비교</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ul class=\"concept-flow concept-comparison\"><li><strong>클러스터</strong><span>가까이 배치·통신 성능</span></li><li><strong>스프레드</strong><span>개별 하드웨어 분산</span></li><li><strong>파티션</strong><span>그룹별 장애 영역 분리</span></li></ul><p class=\"diagram-note\">성능과 장애 분리 중 어떤 요구가 중요한지에 따라 전략을 선택합니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>분산 데이터 저장 시스템의 복제본이 같은 하드웨어 장애에 묶이지 않도록 파티션 배치를 적용하고, 애플리케이션도 파티션 정보를 활용해 복제본을 나눕니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>파티션</strong> — 다른 파티션과 랙 단위의 하드웨어를 공유하지 않도록 구성한 배치 단위입니다. 한 파티션 안에는 여러 인스턴스가 배치될 수 있습니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/placement-groups.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Placement groups for your Amazon EC2 instances ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q028/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q028\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q028\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q028</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q028/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which placement strategy reduces network latency among HPC nodes within one Availability Zone?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q028\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A spread placement group</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q028\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q028\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Instances in different Regions</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q028\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A cluster placement group</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · Cluster는 한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 내 인스턴스를 가깝게 배치한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/\">Placement Group</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q029\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q029\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q029</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q029/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to place a small number of critical EC2 instances on distinct underlying hardware. Which placement strategy should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q029\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Copy an AMI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q029\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A cluster placement group</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q029\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 replication</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q029\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A spread placement group</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · Spread는 개별 인스턴스를 별도 기본 하드웨어에 분산한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/\">Placement Group</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q030\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q030\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q030</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q030/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to distribute many data processing nodes across isolated groups of underlying hardware. Which placement strategy should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q030\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A default network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q030\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A cluster placement group</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q030\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A partition placement group</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q030\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon CloudFront</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · Partition은 노드를 논리 파티션에 분산해 파티션 간 하드웨어 장애 영향을 분리한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/\">Placement Group</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q032\" data-revision=\"2\" id=\"question-Q032\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q032</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q032/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company must use existing per-socket software licenses on EC2 and needs visibility into physical sockets and cores, plus control over instance placement on a specific host. Which option should it choose?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q032\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Dedicated Instances</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q032\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Dedicated Hosts</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q032\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Compute Savings Plans</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q032\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Spot Instances</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Dedicated Hosts</a>는 Physical Host의 Socket·Core 가시성과 Instance Placement·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Host Affinity</a>를 제공한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-instances\">Dedicated Instances</a>는 전용 Hardware 격리를 제공하지만 같은 Host 제어·가시성을 제공하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/\">Placement Group</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q046\" data-revision=\"2\" id=\"question-Q046\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q046</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q046/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company requires EC2 instances to run on hardware isolated from instances belonging to other AWS accounts. It does not need socket visibility, host affinity, or control over a specific physical server. Which option most directly meets these requirements?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q046\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An On-Demand Capacity Reservation in shared tenancy</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q046\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Dedicated Instances</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q046\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A cluster placement group in shared tenancy</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q046\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Regional Reserved Instances in shared tenancy</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-instances\">Dedicated Instances</a>는 다른 계정과 Hardware를 분리한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Dedicated Hosts</a>의 Host 제어가 필요하지 않은 요구와 구분한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-capacity-reservations\">Capacity Reservation</a>과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#regional-and-zonal-reserved-instances\">Regional RI</a>는 그 자체로 Dedicated Tenancy를 제공하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/\">Placement Group</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/types/\">이전 용어 <b>Object / File / Block</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">다음 용어 <b>QuickSight / Quick Sight</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
